Subject: [SteadDesk] Limit merchant Android peer file I/O to advertised directories

Android supplies the primary volume for the calling user and its current AppOp.
Check paths at dispatch, recursive access and transfer-job I/O. Advertise the
scope to the desktop file manager; U-04's optional renderer uses the same menu.

